  "reason": "Evidence: config_007 (scvi_n200, imagenet_vit_l, transformer, weighted, multiprofile) is the best at 0.7250. The top performers all share scvi_n200 + multiprofile + transformer aggregation. The two remaining unexplored axes in this high-performing neighborhood are the image encoder (resnet50 vs imagenet_vit_l) and fusion (concat vs weighted) in combination. config_031 showed resnet50 + transformer + weighted = 0.7131 (with notably higher F1 of 0.6945 than config_007's 0.6847), and config_036 showed imagenet_vit_l + transformer + concat = 0.7207. The interaction of resnet50 with concat fusion (config_050) is untested and is the closest untested variant to the current best. It tests whether resnet50's more compact feature space interacts favorably with concat fusion, potentially closing the small gap to config_007. With only 1 experiment remaining after this, this is the highest-expected-value test: it either finds a marginal improvement or definitively confirms config_007 as the search-space optimum, allowing the final experiment to be a targeted refinement."
}

